<title>HUNGARY: Martfu, Soproni suspended for day.</title>
<headline>Martfu, Soproni suspended for day.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange said it suspended trading in breweries Soproni and Martfu for the day because of news about a merger of the two.</p>
<p>The owner, Austrian beverage Brau Union AG said earlier on Thursday that it would merge its two Hungarian breweries Martfu and Sopron and would offer to buy out Martfu shares at 206 ats per share.</p>
<p>Brau Union said in a brief statement it would reveal further details of the merger at a news conference in Budapest at 1300 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
